ty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Rogers County came in under 90% of normal for November to December in 40 of the 75 years on record since 1951. On the middle, 2025 ran 185% of normal in April to May and then just 42% in November to December. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 40% of normal on the middle. Grid 19639 had its driest year in 1963 at 50%.</p>"}
